 component, LLM chat UI, OpenAI setup, and chat architecture comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor AI Chat\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Packages\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Namespace Quick Reference\r","Required Registration (all three steps must be present)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","BYOK Setup Guide\r","Required Credentials by Provider\r","Install Ollama on Windows\r","List already-installed models\r","Pull a model if not already installed (examples below)\r","Ollama starts automatically; default server URL: http://localhost:11434\r","No API key required for local use\r","Secret Storage — What to Configure\r","Azure OpenAI\r","OpenAI\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · ai · chat"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-charts/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-charts","description":"Generate and configure DevExpress Blazor Charts (DxChart, DxPieChart, DxPolarChart) for common chart types (line/bar/area/pie/donut/scatter/bubble/financial), data binding, axes, series, labels, tooltips, legends, annotations, zoom/pan, palettes, selection, and export/print. Also use for Blazor charts, data visualization, dashboards, and chart feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Charts\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Pattern\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Series Types\r","Data Binding\r","Axes & Labels\r","Descriptive Elements & Customization\r","User Interaction & Zoom\r","Quick Start Example\r","Key Properties & API Surface\r","DxChart / DxPieChart / DxPolarChart (shared)\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · 图表"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-combobox/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-combobox","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor ComboBox (DxComboBox) — a drop-down/select editor for Blazor Server, WebAssembly, and Hybrid apps. Use for data binding (sync/async), searching/filtering, grouping, virtualization, multi-column item lists, templates (item/edit box), validation in EditForm, Clear button and custom buttons, and cascading combo boxes. Also use for DxComboBox, combo box, dropdown, select, item picker, AllowUserInput, SearchMode, and editor feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor ComboBox\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Setup (existing project)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Key Properties & API Surface\r","`DxComboBox<TData, TValue>` — most-used members\r","`DxListEditorColumn` — for multi-column drop-down\r","Enums\r","Common Patterns\r","Pattern 1 — Bind to a Custom Object Collection\r","Pattern 2 — Search & Filter with Group Data\r","Pattern 3 — Multi-Column Drop-Down\r","Troubleshooting\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · combobox"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-gauges/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-gauges","description":"Generate and configure DevExpress Blazor visualization components such as DxBarGauge, DxRangeSelector, DxSankey, DxSparkline, and DxMap. Use when building dashboards with gauges and range selection, Sankey flow diagrams, sparklines/mini charts, and interactive maps (data binding, labels, palettes, selection/hover/click events). Also use for bar gauge, range selector, Sankey, sparkline, map, and visualization feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Visualization Components\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","DxBarGauge — Quick Pattern\r","DxSankey — Quick Pattern\r","DxSparkline — Quick Pattern\r","DxRangeSelector — Quick Pattern\r","DxMap — Quick Pattern\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Bar Gauge\r","Range Selector\r","Sankey\r","Sparkline\r","Map\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · gauges"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-grid/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-grid","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor Grid (DxGrid) — a full-featured data grid for Blazor Server, WebAssembly, and Hybrid apps. Use when binding tabular data (IEnumerable/IQueryable/EF Core/server-mode/custom sources), enabling sorting/filtering/grouping/search, implementing CRUD editing (row/edit form/popup/cell), handling selection and focused rows, exporting to CSV/XLSX/PDF, customizing templates and summaries, and supporting large datasets with virtualization. Also use for DxGrid, DevExpress grid, Blazor data grid, virtual scrolling, server mode, and grid feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Grid\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Setup (existing project)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point (Razor)\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Data Binding\r","Columns & Templates\r","Editing & Validation\r","Data Shaping\r","Export\r","Selection\r","Drag-and-Drop\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · grid"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-pivot-table/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-pivot-table","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor Pivot Table (DxPivotTable) — an interactive pivot grid / cross-tab analysis component for Blazor. Use for pivot-style row/column aggregation (sum/count/avg/min/max), field layout (area/area index), date grouping (year/quarter/month), interactive filtering, and building analytical dashboards. Also use for DxPivotTable, pivot grid, pivot table, cross-tab, OLAP-style analysis, and pivot feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Pivot Table\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Packages (two packages required)\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Setup\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point (Razor)\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Data Binding\r","Fields & Areas\r","Examples\r","Quick Start Example\r","Key Properties\r","DxPivotTable\r","DxPivotTableField\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · pivot · 表"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-ribbon/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-ribbon","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor Ribbon (DxRibbon) — an Office-style tabbed command UI for Blazor. Use when creating ribbon tabs, groups, and items; application menu (File); contextual tabs; toggle/check items and radio groups; and embedding editors like combo boxes, spin edits, and color palettes. Also use for DxRibbon, ribbon UI, Office ribbon, command bar, and ribbon feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Ribbon\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Required Registration (all three steps must be present)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point (Minimal)\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Structure and Items\r","Contextual and Advanced\r","Quick Start Example\r","More Examples\r","Key Properties & API Surface\r","DxRibbon\r","DxRibbonApplicationTab\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · ribbon"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-scheduler/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-scheduler","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor Scheduler (DxScheduler) — a calendar/appointment scheduling component for Blazor Server, WebAssembly, and Hybrid apps. Use for day/week/work-week/month/timeline views; data binding via DxSchedulerDataStorage and AppointmentMappings; appointment creation, editing, deletion, drag-and-drop and resize; recurring appointments (RecurrenceInfo / recurrence rules); resources (rooms/people); labels/statuses; and time/work-time configuration. Also use for DxScheduler, scheduler, calendar, appointment calendar, recurring appointments, and scheduling feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Scheduler\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Setup\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point (Razor)\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Data Binding\r","Appointments\r","Views\r","Examples\r","Quick Start Example\r","Key Properties\r","DxScheduler\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · scheduler"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-toolbar/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-toolbar","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor Toolbar (DxToolbar) — an adaptive command bar for Blazor apps. Use when adding toolbars/command bars, configuring DxToolbarItem buttons, drop-down menus, overflow/adaptivity, icons/tooltips/links, checked and radio-group items, data binding, item templates (ChildContent/Template), and triggering actions like form submission. Also use for DxToolbar, DxToolbarItem, adaptive toolbar, overflow menu, command bar, and toolbar feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor Toolbar\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Required Registration (all three steps must be present)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Items and Interactions\r","Adaptivity and Appearance\r","Quick Start Example\r","More Examples\r","What This Does\r","Key Properties & API Surface\r","DxToolbar\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · toolbar"},{"path":"skills/devexpress-blazor-treelist/SKILL.md","name":"devexpress-blazor-treelist","description":"Build and configure the DevExpress Blazor TreeList (DxTreeList) — a hierarchical data grid / tree grid for Blazor Server, WebAssembly, and Hybrid apps. Use when displaying tree-structured or parent-child data; binding flat data with KeyFieldName, ParentKeyFieldName, and RootValue; expanding/collapsing nodes; sorting, filtering, search box, and filter panel; implementing CRUD editing for tree nodes; exporting to CSV/XLSX/PDF; loading child nodes on demand; and reordering/re-parenting nodes with drag-and-drop. Also use for DxTreeList, DevExpress TreeList, tree grid, hierarchical grid, parent-child table, and tree grid feature comparisons or migration scenarios.","headings":["DevExpress Blazor TreeList\r","When to Use This Skill\r","Prerequisites & Installation\r","NuGet Package\r","Install from NuGet.org:\r","Setup (existing project)\r","Before You Start — Ask the Developer\r","Component Overview\r","Core Entry Point (Razor)\r","Documentation & Navigation Guide\r","Getting Started\r","Data Binding\r","Editing & Validation\r","Data Shaping\r","Export\r","Drag-and-Drop\r","Examples\r","Quick Start Example\r"],"name_hint":"devexpress · blazor · treelist"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["AI Agent Skills for DevExpress Blazor Components","Prerequisites","Included AI Agent Skills","Skill Folder Content"]}],"mcp_servers":["dxdocs","dxdocs","dxdocs","dxdocs"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","README.md","plugin.json","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/SKILL.md","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/examples/file-attachments.razor","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/examples/multi-provider.razor","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/examples/quickstart.razor","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/examples/save-restore-history.razor","skills/devexpress-blazor-ai-chat/examples/tool-calling.razor","skills/dev